# Toolchain versions — the single source of truth for every tool this project
# builds, tests, or deploys with.
#
# Why this file exists: §0.5A requires that "it passes on my machine" is not a
# claim this project accepts. That is only enforceable if the machine is the
# same everywhere, so dev, CI, and deploy all run inside one image built from
# these pins. Changing a version here changes the image's content-addressed
# tag, which rebuilds it and re-runs every check against the new toolchain —
# the drift becomes a reviewable diff instead of a surprise.
#
# Every entry carries a sha256 for both architectures. The base image is pinned
# by its multi-arch *index* digest so the identical reference resolves on an
# arm64 workstation and an amd64 GitHub runner.
#
# To bump a tool: change the version, run `make toolchain-checksums` to
# recompute the hashes, and commit both together. A version bumped without its
# checksum fails the build rather than silently downloading something else.

# Base image: golang:1.25.12-trixie, multi-arch index digest.
BASE_IMAGE=golang@sha256:d41da62c5fa95d88bac8ea732451c00f76aefc5ba4931b694879f4ae15676db8

# Go is supplied by the base image; recorded here so the version is greppable
# and so the go.mod toolchain directive and CI cannot drift from it.
GO_VERSION=1.25.12

# AWS CLI v2 — deploy, teardown, and every lifecycle script (§11.4).
AWSCLI_VERSION=2.34.45
AWSCLI_SHA256_arm64=bf29e06a06fb9bac2a3803931e6618a9f7c9f4c6632ec3b587184850b8f03433
AWSCLI_SHA256_amd64=2b382fd5c1e8d73f6aaca18e5850758fb9f70a20af9c17deb3078df0dd4af095

# yq — reads config/instances/*.yaml in CI and in the deploy scripts.
YQ_VERSION=4.53.3
YQ_SHA256_arm64=578648e463a11c1b6db6010cbf41eafed6bee79466fcffa1bb446672cf7945ea
YQ_SHA256_amd64=fa52a4e758c63d38299163fbdd1edfb4c4963247918bf9c1c5d31d84789eded4

# shellcheck — every script in scripts/ is linted (§11.3 conventions).
SHELLCHECK_VERSION=0.11.0
SHELLCHECK_SHA256_arm64=12b331c1d2db6b9eb13cfca64306b1b157a86eb69db83023e261eaa7e7c14588
SHELLCHECK_SHA256_amd64=8c3be12b05d5c177a04c29e3c78ce89ac86f1595681cab149b65b97c4e227198

# shfmt — shell formatting, so script style is mechanical rather than reviewed.
SHFMT_VERSION=3.13.1
SHFMT_SHA256_arm64=32d92acaa5cd8abb29fc49dac123dc412442d5713967819d8af2c29f1b3857c7
SHFMT_SHA256_amd64=fb096c5d1ac6beabbdbaa2874d025badb03ee07929f0c9ff67563ce8c75398b1

# bun — frontend bundler and TypeScript transpiler. Chosen over a Node
# toolchain because it is one binary with no dependency tree of its own, which
# is what keeps this image small enough to pull on every CI job. See
# docs/decisions/0004-frontend-stack.md; the frontend has no framework, so a
# bundler and a transpiler is the whole requirement.
BUN_VERSION=1.3.14
BUN_SHA256_arm64=a27ffb63a8310375836e0d6f668ae17fa8d8d18b88c37c821c65331973a19a3b
BUN_SHA256_amd64=951ee2aee855f08595aeec6225226a298d3fea83a3dcd6465c09cbccdf7e848f
